                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "56741aa6-1987-4fa0-b90f-137279a483cf",
                                "sense_id": "76a8b058-81d5-3e9a-9011-73c047605b27",
                                "text": "Gdyby prof. Jerzego Roberta Nowaka próbować opisać tak, jak on opisuje swoich bohaterów, byłoby to dość proste: 68-letni żydożerca, który służył reżimowi komunistycznemu, a potem stał się jego największym przeciwnikiem.",
                                "translation": "If we were to try and describe professor Jerzy Robert Nowak the way he describes his heroes, it would be quite easy: a 68-year-old anti-Semite who had served the communist regime and later became its greatest opponent.",
                                "english": "If we were to try and describe professor Jerzy Robert Nowak the way he describes his heroes, it would be quite easy: a 68-year-old anti-Semite who had served the communist regime and later became its greatest opponent."
                            }
                        ]
